</div><div id='about'><div class="bgclolr mmrbtnone">
      <h2 class="section-header">            <div>
               About Shree Jalaram Heights            </div>
            </h2>
  <div class="boxshdo">
    <div class="contenttext">
      <div class="textshowhide">
        <p>Loaded with all world class amenities and strategically located, Shree Jalaram Heights is an address which only a people like, who are destined for eminence in life. The residents of these Residential Apartments in <a href="https://www.commonfloor.com/listing-search?city=Buldhana&cg=&iscg=&search_intent=sale&polygon=1&page=1&page_size=30">Buldhana</a> enjoys a lifestyle that is sought by many and experienced by few. Shree Jalaram Heights in <a href="https://www.commonfloor.com/listing-search?city=Buldhana&cg=&iscg=&search_intent=sale&polygon=1&page=1&page_size=30">Shegaon</a> offers you an elite lifestyle that you have always cherished. The floor plan of Shree Jalaram Heights enables best utilisation of space such that every room, kitchen, bathroom or balconies appear to be more bigger and spacious. Shree Jalaram Heights offers 1 BHK and 2 BHK luxurious Apartments in Buldhana. The master plan of Shree Jalaram Heights ensures that these Apartments in Shegaon are Vastu compliant to present its residents with a cheerful mood and blissful life throughout all seasons. Location of Shree Jalaram Heights is perfect for the ones who desire to invest in property in Buldhana with many schools, colleges, hospitals, supermarkets, recreational areas, parks and many other facilities nearby Shegaon. Currently Shree Jalaram Heights is ongoing. The price of Apartments in Shree Jalaram Heights starts from 16.28 lakhs.</p><br />
<p>Shree Jalaram Heights is Consist Min 600 sqft. and 700 sqft unit Size.</p><br />
<p>Shree Jalaram Heights Completion in Dec-2024.</p><br />
<p>Address : Shegaon, Buldhana, Maharashtra, INDIA..</p><br />
<p> </p><br />
      </div>
       
